{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PgpKeyPurpose","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"open"}]},{"type":"text","text":" enum. A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list decodes to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than failing the response it arrived in (CONTRACT.md §27.11 rule 1). Throwing there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails the WHOLE response, so one field of one record would take down the page it was on,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including the records the caller did ask for."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carrying an unrecognised value back into an update is refused by the server rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written as a spelling it never used. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"type":"text","text":" over these cases needs an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" arm."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The purpose of an OpenPGP key.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/